\ ==== arithmetic ====

2 3 + .
10 4 - .
6 7 * .
20 5 / .
5 negate .

\ float-specialized arithmetic — same results as generic
2 3 f+ .
10 4 f- .
6 7 f* .
20 5 f/ .

\ f+ only consumes top two (verifies in-place behaviour)
99 2 3 f+ . .

\ f/ rejects division by zero
1 0 f/

\ fused multiply-add: ( a b c -- a*b+c )
2 3 4 f*+ .
10 5 100 f*+ .
99 2 3 4 f*+ . .

\ fused multiply-subtract: ( a b c -- c - a*b )
10 2 3 f*- .
100 5 4 f*- .

clear

\ ==== arithmetic shortcuts ====

\ 1+ ( n -- n+1 ), 1- ( n -- n-1 ), sq ( n -- n*n ) — polymorphic (float + matrix).
\ Matrix element-wise forms are covered in 41_math_unary; here exercise floats.

\ basic
5 1+ . cr             \ 6
5 1- . cr             \ 4
5 sq . cr             \ 25

\ composes
3 1+ sq . cr          \ 16
10 sq 1- . cr         \ 99
0 1- 1- 1- . cr       \ -3

\ floats with fractions
0.5 1+ . cr           \ 1.5
0.25 sq . cr          \ 0.0625

\ inside a quotation, with times: the running value is on the stack
[: 0  [: 1+ :] 7 times  . cr :] execute

clear
